# T35 - thesis converted to F, repeated: the old F keeps counting until the new attempt is converted
PROGRAM 8 0 5.00 12 4
COURSE C1 REGULAR 4 CORE -
COURSE TH THESIS 4 CORE -
STUDENT S1 Asha
REGISTER S1 C1 1
GRADE S1 C1 1 A
REGISTER S1 TH 2
GRADE S1 TH 2 S
CONVERT S1 TH F
GPA S1
REGISTER S1 TH 3
GRADE S1 TH 3 S
GPA S1
GRAD S1
CONVERT S1 TH B
GPA S1
GRAD S1
